<center><font class="option" color="#000000"><b>Announcement on the SPOILERS</b></font></center><br>
<font class="content"><div align=justify>Due to <STRONG>a little</STRONG> adverse criticism we received for posting some info about <STRONG>Madonna's upcoming tour, not already spoiled,</STRONG> we decided to publish the next news <STRONG>from tour rehearsals</STRONG>, <STRONG>in the <A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/modules.php?name=Forums&file=viewforum&f=25" target=_blank>Re-Invention Lounge</A> section of our Message Board <A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" target=_blank>MadonnaVillage.it</A>.</STRONG><BR><BR><STRONG>Sorry but you need to register to access our forums, even if you are a Drowned Madonna member.</STRONG><BR><BR>After registered you will receive the confirmation e-mail with your password. <STRONG>If don't please contact us. Then login through the box on the left of each page of </STRONG><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" target=_blank><STRONG>Madonna Village.it</STRONG></A>.<BR><BR><STRONG>The Drowned Madonna Team</STRONG></div></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<br><table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td align="left">
<font class="storytitle" color="#FFFFFF"><b><a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=categories&amp;op=newindex&amp;catid=2"><font class="storycat">EXCLUSIVE</font></a>: 25 Minutes Video of DC second show.</b></font>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P>Our community member <STRONG>MadDCFan</STRONG> (aka <STRONG>Beth</STRONG>) has recorded about <STRONG>25 minutes</STRONG> of video <STRONG>starting in the middle of Vogue and continuing thru non-stop thru 1/2 Burning Up</STRONG>.</P>
<P>Enter our <STRONG><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/modules.php?name=Forums&amp;file=modules&amp;name=Forums&amp;file=viewforum&amp;f=25" target=_blank>Re-Invention Lounge</A></STRONG> to download it and <STRONG>comment it</STRONG>. Hurry Up!</P>
<P><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/modules.php?name=Forums&amp;file=modules&amp;name=Forums&amp;file=viewforum&amp;f=25" target=_blank><IMG src="lounge_s.jpg" border=0></A></P>
</font></div>
