<font class="content">Written by <a href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index.php">Giampiero</a> on Wednesday, June 16 @  W. Europe Daylight Time  [3 reads].</font><br>
<font class="content"">(<a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=3122">comments?</a> | <a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=categories&amp;op=newindex&amp;catid=2">EXCLUSIVE</a> | Score: 0)</font>

</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
