<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td align="left">
<font class="storytitle" color="#FFFFFF"><b>Madonna will  cause a commotion in NYC</b></font>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">Today's NYDAILYNEWS:<BR><STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> will definitely be <STRONG>"Causing a Commotion</STRONG>" with the first of her six soldout performances <STRONG>at Madison Square Garden at 8 p.m. on Wednesday</STRONG>. Her legions of fans will create mega-gridlock at Seventh Ave. and 33rd St. just in time for the afternoon rush. Drivers and pedestrians should also expect parking lanes blocked by media representatives covering the goings-on.<BR>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


