<br><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td align="left">
<font class="storytitle" color="#FFFFFF"><b><a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=categories&amp;op=newindex&amp;catid=10"><font class="storycat">BREAKING NEWS</font></a>: ABC Interview: Madonna'' I'm a rebel ''</b></font>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=8"><img src="images/topics/interviste.gif" border="0" Alt="Interviews" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">Our collaborator <STRONG>Newyorkcityboy</STRONG> informs us that <STRONG>Madonna </STRONG>said <B>"i'm a rebel"</B> in the promo for the friday interview for 20/20. She looked beautiful with long blonde hair (think bedtime story video),and she was laughing and smiling all over the place. She's being interviewd by Cynthia McFadden,so it might be an interesting interview"<BR><BR>meanwhile From<B> ABC.com:</B> <BR><BR><STRONG>Coming up on 20/20: <BR>This Friday at 10 p.m.<BR>EXCLUSIVE: Cynthia McFadden sits down with the queen of self-reinvention, Madonna, who's got a lot to say about faith, family values, growing older — and wiser.</STRONG> 
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
